WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:06.180
In 1993, at Tel Dan in northern Israel,
archaeologists find pieces of a broken

2
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.320
stone.

3
00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:13.350
On it, in Aramaic, an enemy king boasts
of killing a king of the House of David.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.800
It is the first mention of
David outside the Bible.

5
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:21.660
Yet some scholars call David's grand
kingdom a later literary creation.

6
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.890
So was David a real
ruler, a small chieftain,

7
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.070
or a story?

8
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.720
And how would we know?

9
00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:31.160
In this mission, you'll meet
minimalists and maximalists,

10
00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.490
and weigh the evidence.

11
00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.410
Then you'll ask why the stories of Samuel,

12
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.160
Saul and David were told at all.

13
00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:41.750
Your mission: find out what
kind of ruler David was,

14
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.000
and how we could know.
